      {
       "kicker": "Membership model",
       "big": "~51%",
       "title": "of operating income from 1.9% of revenue",
       "text": "Membership fees were $5.9B, under 2% of revenue but about half of operating income (5,907 ÷ 11,685, derived). 84.1M paid members renew at 92.3% in the US and Canada and 89.8% worldwide. Executive members drove ~75.2% of net sales.",
       "src": [
        "10k"
       ]
      },
      {
       "kicker": "Markup cap",
       "big": "14% / 15%",
       "title": "max markup on branded / Kirkland items",
       "text": "\"No branded product is marked up by more than 14% and no Kirkland Signature product by more than 15%.\" The result: an 11.09% gross margin on net sales in FY2026.",
